<updates>
    <!--
        uddeIM Joomla 6 distribution feed.

        6.0.0-beta1 is intentionally not advertised.

        The published beta1 asset was proven byte-identical after Joomla's
        native download, but its Windows-built ZIP member paths use backslashes.
        Joomla therefore aborts native archive extraction before checksum and
        installer execution.

        The beta1 release asset remains immutable for audit/history. A corrected
        prerelease will be advertised under a new version after the portable ZIP
        packaging gate is green.
    -->
</updates>
